Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 14:06:58 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] On-screen countdown for timed play tests

A panel at the top right of the window says what to do and counts down to the recording and to
its end (EDEN_NX2_TEST_START / _SECONDS / _LABEL / _PREPARE, or the sampler's window when
EDEN_NX2_SAMPLE is set). The window's start and end are logged so a log can be cut to it.

